    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Capibara Lost Dreams explores Frank's adventure to escape from a stranded island. He won't be alone on the island, as intelligent Capybaras dominate it with an iron fist. Frank must fight to survive the fierce Capybaras and their leader.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the 19 chapters that make up the game, a whole island full of secrets, chests, collectibles, and Capybaras await you. There's much to explore and discover!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES:</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight to Survive</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919870/extras/ed6d42c5d6c7028ad82a569a6d2aaa07.poster.avif?t=1748239229\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919870/extras/ed6d42c5d6c7028ad82a569a6d2aaa07.webm?t=1748239229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919870/extras/ed6d42c5d6c7028ad82a569a6d2aaa07.mp4?t=1748239229\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You'll have different weapons at your disposal, such as swords, axes, a bow, and your fists. You'll also need to defend yourself with your shield and dodge enemies. But be careful! Watch your stamina.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Experience and Leveling</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919870/extras/9c3ac98dd8d885ee9f0366cec955fa3f.poster.avif?t=1748239229\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919870/extras/9c3ac98dd8d885ee9f0366cec955fa3f.webm?t=1748239229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919870/extras/9c3ac98dd8d885ee9f0366cec955fa3f.mp4?t=1748239229\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Every time you defeat an enemy, you'll earn experience points to level up your character. This allows you to improve your health, energy bar, and strength.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Campfires and Chests</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919870/extras/2a73c2dfbb6854b960290e90da9fbf4e.poster.avif?t=1748239229\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919870/extras/2a73c2dfbb6854b960290e90da9fbf4e.webm?t=1748239229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919870/extras/2a73c2dfbb6854b960290e90da9fbf4e.mp4?t=1748239229\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Use campfires to rest and improve your character. They also serve as respawn points when you're killed. Additionally, the island is full of hidden chests that you can find to obtain rewards.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Exploration</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919870/extras/54482bf6172c42776316935d2fdb54f9.poster.avif?t=1748239229\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919870/extras/54482bf6172c42776316935d2fdb54f9.webm?t=1748239229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919870/extras/54482bf6172c42776316935d2fdb54f9.mp4?t=1748239229\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Exploring will reward you with resources for your adventure, from healing items to arrows and even trash. There are also many hidden collectibles.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Stealth</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919870/extras/a17f92b08e77f68c5fa93509be2b4d3e.poster.avif?t=1748239229\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919870/extras/a17f92b08e77f68c5fa93509be2b4d3e.webm?t=1748239229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919870/extras/a17f92b08e77f68c5fa93509be2b4d3e.mp4?t=1748239229\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You can hide among bushes to infiltrate dangerous areas of main missions or confront a multitude of cultist Capybaras head-on. The choice is yours; you have the freedom to approach missions as you wish.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919870/extras/c7c208d44814b3a05c820dbcfb94d43e.poster.avif?t=1748239229\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919870/extras/c7c208d44814b3a05c820dbcfb94d43e.webm?t=1748239229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919870/extras/c7c208d44814b3a05c820dbcfb94d43e.mp4?t=1748239229\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Explore dangerous dungeons full of traps and enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*You can buy clothes and items from vendors scattered throughout the island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*There are kind-hearted Capybaras on the island who will need your help.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*You can execute enemies from behind if they haven't detected you yet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Capibara Lost Dreams explores Frank's adventure to escape from a stranded island. He won't be alone on the island, as intelligent Capybaras dominate it with an iron fist. Frank must fight to survive the fierce Capybaras and their leader.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the 19 chapters that make up the game, a whole island full of secrets, chests, collectibles, and Capybaras await you. There's much to explore and discover!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES:</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight to Survive</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919870/extras/ed6d42c5d6c7028ad82a569a6d2aaa07.poster.avif?t=1748239229\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919870/extras/ed6d42c5d6c7028ad82a569a6d2aaa07.webm?t=1748239229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919870/extras/ed6d42c5d6c7028ad82a569a6d2aaa07.mp4?t=1748239229\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You'll have different weapons at your disposal, such as swords, axes, a bow, and your fists. You'll also need to defend yourself with your shield and dodge enemies. But be careful! Watch your stamina.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Experience and Leveling</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919870/extras/9c3ac98dd8d885ee9f0366cec955fa3f.poster.avif?t=1748239229\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919870/extras/9c3ac98dd8d885ee9f0366cec955f