8239229\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Exploring will reward you with resources for your adventure, from healing items to arrows and even trash. There are also many hidden collectibles.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Stealth</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919870/extras/a17f92b08e77f68c5fa93509be2b4d3e.poster.avif?t=1748239229\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919870/extras/a17f92b08e77f68c5fa93509be2b4d3e.webm?t=1748239229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919870/extras/a17f92b08e77f68c5fa93509be2b4d3e.mp4?t=1748239229\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You can hide among bushes to infiltrate dangerous areas of main missions or confront a multitude of cultist Capybaras head-on. The choice is yours; you have the freedom to approach missions as you wish.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919870/extras/c7c208d44814b3a05c820dbcfb94d43e.poster.avif?t=1748239229\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919870/extras/c7c208d44814b3a05c820dbcfb94d43e.webm?t=1748239229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919870/extras/c7c208d44814b3a05c820dbcfb94d43e.mp4?t=1748239229\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Explore dangerous dungeons full of traps and enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*You can buy clothes and items from vendors scattered throughout the island.</p><p